{"id":4,"name":"Rectangle","x":184.5,"y":30.0,"w":14.0,"h":17.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,204],"outline":[34,34,34,255],"width":1.0,"radius":1.0}}},{"id":5,"name":"North Arrow","x":186.0,"y":31.0,"w":11.0,"h":15.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"NorthArrow":{"frame":1,"style":"Compass","fill":[34,34,34,255],"outline":[34,34,34,255]}}},{"id":6,"name":"Rectangle","x":11.0,"y":218.5,"w":32.0,"h":9.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Rectangle":{"fill":[255,255,255,204],"outline":[34,34,34,255],"width":1.0,"radius":1.0}}},{"id":7,"name":"Scale Bar","x":13.0,"y":220.0,"w":30.0,"h":6.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"ScaleBar":{"frame":1,"units":"Kilometers","divisions":2,"style":"Line"}}},{"id":8,"name":"Legend","x":10.0,"y":232.0,"w":58.0,"h":50.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Legend":{"frame":1,"title":"Estrato predominante","all_classes":false,"hide_other":false,"exclude":["Barranquilla"]}}},{"id":9,"name":"Text","x":72.0,"y":232.0,"w":128.0,"h":21.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Cómo se hizo: todo en RustGIS web (web.rustgis.app), con tres scripts.\n1 · Datos: el estrato predominante por manzana en 5 consultas PBF de 2000 manzanas y el límite\n     municipal del IGAC, sobre el mapa base oscuro Mi Ciudad de la Alcaldía, con su estilo oficial.\n2 · Vista: Merge de las 5 consultas; Unique Values por ESTRATO_PREDOMINANTE_INT, un color\n     (morado a amarillo, magma) y una etiqueta por estrato (1 · Bajo-bajo … 6 · Alto).\n3 · Layout: armado por script. Los scripts: github.com/jgregoriorincon/30DayMapChallenge-2026","size":7.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":10,"name":"Text","x":72.0,"y":255.0,"w":128.0,"h":13.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"Datos: Estrato predominante por manzana 2018 — DANE, Equipo de Esri Colombia (CNPV 2018;\nreferencial, no oficial). Límite municipal: IGAC. Consultado el 2026-11-03.\nMapa base: Mi Ciudad (oscuro), Alcaldía de Barranquilla.","size":7.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false}}},{"id":11,"name":"Text","x":10.0,"y":284.0,"w":190.0,"h":6.0,"visible":true,"kind":{"Text":{"text":"#30DayMapChallenge 2026 · Día 3: Polygons · Hecho con RustGIS · rustgis.app","size":8.0,"color":[31,41,55,255],"bold":false,"align":"Right"}}}],"series":null,"next_id":12}],"folders":[],"styles":[],"ramps":[],"tasks":[],"gp_env":{"extent":null,"cell_size":null},"models":[],"workspaces":[],"link_views":false,"jobs":[],"offline_areas":[],"reports":[],"presentations":[],"notebooks":[],"dl_models":[],"shared":[],"data_stores":[]}